---
import ProgramPage from '../../components/templates/ProgramPage.astro';
import PriceFacts from '../../components/pages/classes-adult/PriceFacts.astro';
---
<ProgramPage
  title="No-Gi Jiu-Jitsu (Wrestle-Jitsu) in Hayward, CA | United Wrestling Club"
  description="No-gi jiu-jitsu for adults in Hayward, CA, taught as Wrestle-Jitsu: submission grappling built on wrestling fundamentals. Try a 3-Day Mat Pass for $15."
  path="/classes/nogi-jiu-jitsu/"
  eyebrow="Adult class"
  heading="No-Gi Jiu-Jitsu"
  headingBrand="(Wrestle-Jitsu)"
  lead="Submission grappling taught with wrestling fundamentals, for adults."
  schedule={{ program: 'adult', tag: 'nogi' }}
  trialProgram="adult"
>
  <p>Our no-gi jiu-jitsu class combines grappling technique with proven wrestling fundamentals. It is led by a jiu-jitsu black belt who also wrestled in college. The curriculum bridges submission grappling and competitive wrestling so you learn to work in every range.</p>
  <p>We call this class Wrestle-Jitsu.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4 text-3xl font-black uppercase leading-tight md:text-[2.75rem]">Prices</h2>
  <PriceFacts />
  <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4 text-3xl font-black uppercase leading-tight md:text-[2.75rem]">Class times</h2>
</ProgramPage>
